# AI Chatbot

## Overview
AI Chatbot is a conversational application designed to interact with users and provide intelligent responses in real time. The project demonstrates the use of artificial intelligence concepts to create an engaging and user-friendly chat experience.

## Features
- Interactive chat interface
- Real-time responses
- User-friendly design
- Fast and responsive performance
- Easy to use and customize

## Technologies Used
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- AI/Chatbot APIs (if used)

## How to Run
1. Download or clone the repository.
2. Open the project folder.
3. Run the application by opening `index.html` in a web browser.
4. Start chatting with the AI chatbot.

## Project Structure
- `index.html` – Main webpage
- `style.css` – Styling for the chatbot
- `script.js` – Chatbot functionality

